VEED just dropped Dynamic Subtitles, an AI that creates viral-style captions for your videos automatically. Upload your video, the AI reads it and picks the most important words, then those words pop, pulse, and scale right when you say them. You pick a style like Glide, Pulse, Fusion, Whisper, or Handwritten, each one looks completely different. The AI highlights emphasis automatically, but you can click any word to toggle it on or off. Works in 40 languages.

@VEEDSTUDIO 

